\t<dd>\n\t\t\t모든학년 소득분위별 50~200만원\n\t\t</dd>\n\t</dl>\n\n\t<p>\n\t\t농림축산식품부\n\t</p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t농어촌희망재단\n\t</p>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">아래와 같이 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2020-2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 농림축산식품부 장학생 선발안내를 아래와 같이 알려드리니,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">선발요강을 확인하시고 신청해 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">[우리대학은 농업인자녀장학금만 해당이 됩니다]</span></strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font