, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;- </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">농업인의 자녀(본인 농업인 신청불가, 부모가 반드시 농업 종사자여야 함)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;- </span></span></span>부모의 농업인 증빙서류 발행이 가능한 재학생(학과 및 전공 제한 없음)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 소득분위 등에 따라 등록금 범위 내&nbsp;최대 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">200만원, 150만원, 100만원, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">50</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">만원 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 장학생 선발 성적</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">​<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;- </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">202